# sdist 内容安全网：本仓为多仓工作区控制面（manifest 驱动），
# 根目录下的 repos//reference/ 等为独立克隆或 vendored 材料，绝不进入分发物。
# 缺少本文件时，历史配置会把 repos/(14G)、cache/、build/、.roo/ 打进 sdist，
# 并使 setuptools 在打包阶段做全树扫描，导致 `uv sync` 表现“卡死”。
include LICENSE
include README.md
include pyproject.toml
include aix_launcher.py
include bootstrap.py

prune repos
prune reference
prune build
prune cache
prune reports
prune tmp
prune .aix
prune .roo
prune .claude
prune .codex
prune .windsurf
prune .cursor
prune .agents
prune docs
prune schemas
prune manifests
prune workflows
prune policies
prune overrides
prune workflow

global-exclude *.py[cod] __pycache__/* *.so *.egg-info/* *.log *.jou *.wlf *.vcd *.fsdb *.shm